    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Making a threat of contamination with intent to cause public alarm or economic loss is prohibited.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The person makes a threat that goods will be contaminated.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person is guilty of an offence if...";
