    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Permission";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The person making the threat has permission to do so if they are a constitutional corporation.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(vii) the loss takes the form of detriment to constitutional trade and commerce;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "...(vii) the goods are in the course of, or intended for, constitutional trade and commerce;";
