<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3-logic-deontic-1>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits possessing or bringing prohibited goods into Australia.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The person possesses goods on board a ship or aircraft; or brings goods into Australia; or imports goods into Australia; or possesses goods that have been imported into Australia in contravention of this Act;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "An offence is committed if the person possesses or brings prohibited goods into Australia.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3-logic-deontic-2>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3-logic-deontic-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits exporting prohibited goods from Australia.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) The person exports goods from Australia; or fails to disclose to an officer on demand any knowledge in his or her possession or power concerning the exportation or intended exportation from Australia of goods;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "An offence is committed if the person exports prohibited goods from Australia.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3-logic-deontic-3>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/act-sch-5-sec-3-logic-deontic-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Justify";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Justifies the prohibition on possessing or bringing prohibited goods into Australia.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1AAB) Subparagraph (1)(a)(i), (ii), (iv), (v) or (vi) does not apply if the person proves that the person had a reasonable excuse for doing the act referred to in that subparagraph.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person may justify their action if they have a reasonable excuse.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
